  "description": "Ask questions about your documents, databases, images and audio in natural language. Multi-database RAG library for .NET that queries SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite together with AI. On-premise ready with Ollama, Whisper.net. GDPR/KVKK/HIPAA compliant. Compatible with .NET Core 3.0+ and .NET 5/6/7/8/9.",
