  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release 3.3.0: Redis Vector Search & Storage Improvements (MINOR Release - 2025-12-01)\n\nNEW FEATURES:\n- ConversationStorageProvider Separation: Separated conversation storage from document storage for better architecture\n- Redis RediSearch Integration: Enhanced vector similarity search with RediSearch module support\n- Redis Vector Search Configuration: Vector index algorithm, distance metric, and dimension configuration\n- RedisInsight UI Support: Docker Compose setup includes RedisInsight for Redis management\n- InMemory Storage Option: Added to demo initialization menu for easy testing\n\nIMPROVEMENTS:\n- Redis Vector Search: Proper relevance score calculation and assignment for DocumentSearchService\n- Redis Embedding Generation: Correct AIProviderConfig passing for embedding generation\n- StorageFactory DI: Resolved dependency injection scope issues with IAIProvider\n- Redis Docker Setup: Updated to redis/redis-stack-server:latest image (includes RediSearch)\n\nFIXES:\n- StorageFactory Dependency Injection: Fixed IAIProvider scope issue using lazy resolution\n- Redis Relevance Scoring: Fixed RelevanceScore assignment in RedisDocumentRepository for vector search\n- Redis Embedding Config: Fixed NullReferenceException when generating embeddings\n\nREMOVED:\n- FileSystemDocumentRepository: Removed unused file system storage implementation\n- SqliteDocumentRepository: Removed unused SQLite storage implementation\n- StorageConfig Properties: Removed FileSystemPath and SqliteConfig (unused)\n\nCODE QUALITY:\n- Maintained 0 errors, 0 warnings\n- Removed unused code and dependencies\n- Improved Redis vector search accuracy\n\nThis release enhances Redis vector search capabilities and removes unused storage implementations while maintaining backward compatibility for actively used features.",
